{%- comment -%}
  Figma: Components Atoms / Block / Accordion (2170:25589): Accordion with a top divider, items with the plus icon
  Landing block (private: the underscore keeps it out of every other section; only the Landing columns and tabs list it).
  Top and bottom padding are settings on the Figma Spacing scale (spacing/N = N x 4px), as pt-N / pb-N (Hendrik, 24 Nov).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture items -%}{% content_for 'blocks' %}{%- endcapture -%}
<div class="landing-block min-w-0 pt-{{ block.settings.padding_top }} pb-{{ block.settings.padding_bottom }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  {% render 'accordion', items: items, top_divider: true %}
</div>

